{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "990ae9a7-49e0-8a66-865e-abfac0b945b2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:38:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Is this the Registry? I need to know what I need to bring to renew my license. Bottom line, what do I bring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, ma'am, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. The Registry of Motor Vehicles is a state office, so it's a different number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk. Okay. So that's not the Registry. [pause] But it's Newport, right? I thought they were all the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:36:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is Newport, but the city and the state are separate. The Registry handles licenses and registrations. We do things like vital records and city licenses."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So you can't just tell me what to bring? You're government."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wish I could, but I'd be guessing and I don't want to send you down there with the wrong papers. The Registry has its own website and its own phone line, and they can tell you exactly what to bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, you're gonna hear an echo, I'm in my kitchen and it's all tile. I've got you on speaker because my hands are full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Do you want me to tell you how to find their number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, please. I got this number off an old list I had in a drawer. Honestly, I must be dialing from the Stone Age. Half of those numbers probably go to a pizza place now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, it happens. If you search for Rhode Island Registry of Motor Vehicles online, the official state page comes up first, and the contact number is right there. Just make sure it ends in dot gov."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dot gov. Okay. And that's the state, not the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the state. Anything with Rhode Island Division of Motor Vehicles or Registry in the name, that's who you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, is it Division or Registry? Which one is it? Now I'm confused."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "People use both. The one you want is the state's motor vehicles office. If you see either name on a dot gov page, you're in the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Either one. I'll look it up after I finish this sink. So you don't do licenses at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not driver's licenses, no. Just the state does those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Well, thanks. Sorry for the trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Good luck with it, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
